WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.034 --> 00:00:02.301
-Good evening.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.301 --> 00:00:03.203
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.203 --> 00:00:04.503
We hope you're doing well
tonight.

00:00:04.503 --> 00:00:05.572
We're back in the studio,

00:00:05.572 --> 00:00:07.006
and now we are going to
get to the news.

00:00:07.006 --> 00:00:10.143
Tomorrow will mark the end
of the first year

00:00:10.143 --> 00:00:11.911
of President Biden's time
in office,

00:00:11.911 --> 00:00:15.414
so, buddy, you got like 24 hours
to make something happen.

00:00:15.414 --> 00:00:18.284
You got to cancel student debt

00:00:18.284 --> 00:00:20.420
or bring back "Lost"
or something.

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:25.191 line:0%
I mean, even MSNBC
is struggling with headlines.

00:00:25.191 --> 00:00:27.026 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:27.026 --> 00:00:29.863
The House committee
investigating the Capitol attack

00:00:29.863 --> 00:00:32.332
issued a subpoena yesterday
to Rudy Giuliani,

00:00:32.332 --> 00:00:35.134
though really all you have to do
to make Rudy appear

00:00:35.134 --> 00:00:37.837
is draw a pentagram on the floor
with Maalox.

00:00:37.837 --> 00:00:40.340
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:43.109
The Biden administration
announced a plan today

00:00:43.109 --> 00:00:45.478
to give Americans
hundreds of millions

00:00:45.478 --> 00:00:48.047
of high-quality,
medical-grade face masks.

00:00:48.047 --> 00:00:51.450
They're just doing that now?
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.450 --> 00:00:54.387
What are they sending out next,
sourdough starter?

00:00:54.387 --> 00:00:55.454
[ Laughter ]

00:00:55.454 --> 00:00:57.323
That's right,
the Biden administration

00:00:57.323 --> 00:00:59.993
will distribute hundreds of
millions of high-quality masks

00:00:59.993 --> 00:01:02.495
through pharmacies
like Walgreens and CVS.

00:01:02.495 --> 00:01:04.663
Unfortunately,
they're behind the razors,

00:01:04.663 --> 00:01:06.766
and the one guy with the key
is on lunch break.

00:01:06.766 --> 00:01:09.268
[ Laughter ]

00:01:09.268 --> 00:01:12.438
A White House official told CNN
that the distribution

00:01:12.438 --> 00:01:16.275
of 400 million free N95 masks
next week is, quote,

00:01:16.275 --> 00:01:19.645
"the largest deployment
of personal protective equipment

00:01:19.645 --> 00:01:21.915
in U.S. history,"
besides, of course,

00:01:21.915 --> 00:01:24.284
the week that freshmen
head off to college.

00:01:24.284 --> 00:01:26.419
[ Laughter ]

00:01:28.954 --> 00:01:31.691
Democratic Louisiana Senate
candidate Gary Chambers

00:01:31.691 --> 00:01:33.759
released a new campaign ad
yesterday

00:01:33.759 --> 00:01:35.194
about legalizing marijuana

00:01:35.194 --> 00:01:37.529
that appears to show him
smoking a blunt.

00:01:37.529 --> 00:01:40.800
"He's got my vote," said people
who will forget to vote.

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:43.202
[ Laughter ]

00:01:43.202 --> 00:01:47.239
Walmart is reportedly planning
to create its own NFTs.

00:01:47.239 --> 00:01:50.843
And if you want to laugh, ask
one of their greeters about it.

00:01:50.843 --> 00:01:51.945
Arrghh!

00:01:51.945 --> 00:01:53.446
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.446 --> 00:01:56.048
"I have no idea where that is!

00:01:56.048 --> 00:01:58.718
Maybe try sporting goods?"
[ Laughter ]

00:01:58.718 --> 00:02:01.721
The cost for an annual Citi Bike
membership in New York

00:02:01.721 --> 00:02:03.789
will increase next week by $6.

00:02:03.789 --> 00:02:06.592
So to get their money's worth,
riders will have to start

00:02:06.592 --> 00:02:09.329
throwing an additional bike
into the Hudson every week.

00:02:09.329 --> 00:02:12.464
[ Laughter ]

00:02:12.464 --> 00:02:14.333
According to a new survey,

00:02:14.333 --> 00:02:18.037
19% of adults are participating
in so-called dry January,

00:02:18.037 --> 00:02:19.972
which is what your girlfriend
experiences

00:02:19.972 --> 00:02:22.075
when you show her
your Wordle score.

00:02:22.075 --> 00:02:24.077
[ Laughter ]

00:02:29.749 --> 00:02:32.118
Did it feel like 3% better
than we thought?

00:02:32.118 --> 00:02:33.719
[ Laughter ]

00:02:33.719 --> 00:02:36.322
And finally, the Red Cross
will offer blood donors

00:02:36.322 --> 00:02:38.524
a chance to win tickets
to the Super Bowl

00:02:38.524 --> 00:02:40.092
if they donate this month.

00:02:40.092 --> 00:02:43.229
And for many donors, this could
be their only chance to go.

00:02:43.229 --> 00:02:45.365
And that --

00:02:45.365 --> 00:02:46.565
It's a joke about the Jets.

00:02:46.565 --> 00:02:48.268
That was the monologue,
everybody!

